            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## What's new

- **CrewNotch now updates itself.** It checks for new versions once a day and offers to install them in one click. Turn on "Download and install updates automatically" in Settings → General to skip even that, or check any time with **Check for Updates…**.
- Every update is signed and verified before it's installed, and only comes from this project's releases.

]]></description>
